      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "POINT BREAK (1) is progressing well and looks close to another win after hitting the frame from Box 2 last run (29.89) at Sandown. Goes very well from this draw with three wins and three minor placings from seven starts. Top prospect. PAW WINKWORTH (7) comes off an average effort last start when seventh at this track over 525m behind Nova Owen (30.97) in a Grade 4/5. Was in the money prior to that. Likely to be about the mark. PAW VARNA (8) has been hard to follow lately, running fourth (30.38) last time but prior to that ran very well when placed at Horsham. Well placed here and can atone this time. HOLDEN BALE (2) is a last-start placegetter out of the same box - worth considering.",
